  <item>
    <title>3、天冷了，安利几家私藏烧烤店吧。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65636dc4ce2ee31e8f8dccff</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65636dc4ce2ee31e8f8dccff</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Nov 2023 16:09:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>讲讲上海的新疆东北贵州云南烧烤+日本烧鸟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>中途听不下去的，时间表送你一程：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 上海拥有的烧烤风味还是很多元的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 真的有上海本帮特色的烧烤？在长宁区，还有烤目鱼蛋？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a> 新疆烧烤初代网红阿力开去浦东，市区“近替”是哪家？（羊腰好绝很嫩还会爆浆）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 降维打击！这家烧烤店老板有自己的草场养羊，羊肉盐烤就好鲜鲜鲜鲜鲜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">07:03</a> 90%的烧烤店都用内蒙羊，但水好深......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">08:03</a> 到底是羊鲜味还是羊膻味？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a> 上海西南边，东北烧烤尤其多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">10:23</a> 宜宾烧烤部位超细.....大肠和小肠连接段叫______？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="684">11:24</a> 烤猪天梯、猪喉咙绝绝子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a> &nbsp;普陀区有家黑龙江鸡西烧烤，烤大鸡脖太爽了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">12:39</a> 各地烧烤调味好不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">14:23</a> 上海比较正宗的贵阳小串烧烤（还是连锁外卖），胶原蛋白天堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="954">15:54</a> 外环路只能熟人预约制的宝藏烧烤店，只有6张桌子，人均200媲美人均五六百日式烧肉店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a> 上海的云南傣族烧烤，一家在金山，一家在七宝，部位超超超多！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1281">21:21</a> 烤毛肚，打开新世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1314">21:54</a> 烤猪脾脏，一只猪只能串2串</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1387">23:07</a> 傣族烧烤一定要吃“包烧”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1493">24:53</a> 特别想吃但上海没有的烧烤流派？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 上海北边超有氛围的云南烤包浆小豆腐，手撕着蘸酱吃！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a> 最常去的烤鸡皮，只要烧鸟店一半价格，鸡皮自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 讲讲上海最值得吃的烧鸟吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2064">34:24</a> 烧鸟店烤鸡皮不同风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2295">38:15</a> 一根串上炭火不同位置的肉口感不一致，很看店家水平</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>徐大半：即刻@徐大半</span></p><span></span><p><span>美食编辑，上海江西潮汕三地混血，宁波祖籍</span></p><span></span><p><span>周大仙：即刻@盘丝大仙仙</span></p><span></span><p><span>美食编辑，四川自贡人，河南祖籍</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头片尾：福原希己江 - できること (所能做之事) (深夜食堂2撮影現場Ver_)</span></p><span></span><p><span>中间插曲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Buddy Guy _ Tracy Chapman - Ain't No Sun</span></p><span></span><p><span>Aaron Kellim - Where Are We Going</span></p><span></span><p><span>AYEON - More Sunshine</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv0cfwmLeH50eJ7dAHIoAoiYQkE0.m4a" length="59235899" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:19</itunes:duration>
