  <item>
    <title>2、美食编辑是如何找餐厅不踩雷的？（一些非常简单的小tips</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64c29357e8176c3ff8db7671</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64c29357e8176c3ff8db7671</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Jul 2023 15:55:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们的工作=找吃的，工作之外的时间也=找吃的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以来分享一些心得。</span></p><span></span><p><span>中途听不下去的，时间表送你一程：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> 最简单的，当然是关注一些（较为优质+不接广告的）美食公众号+博主。（此段是重点干货，下面可以不听，这段得听完！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a> 大众点评小窍门，3个。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="834">13:54</a> 大众点评的好评：很多是拉皮条拉来的，还有专门拉皮条的微信群。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> 一眼就能判断这家店靠不靠谱的tips，百试不厌！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1263">21:03</a> 差评不一定是坏指标（手动狗头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 点进大众点评评论区，第一件事，很多人没做对。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a> 看一家店的菜单，这几个点要关注。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2062">34:22</a> 小红书，美化比较多，学会甄别。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2189">36:29</a> 出国旅游找餐厅，小红书很好用！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2359">39:19</a> 小红书评论区的杠精，很有存在价值：）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2442">40:42</a> 国外找餐厅，有个软件比Yelp好用太多。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2587">43:07</a> 熟人推荐的餐厅，不一定能信。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> 朋友推荐，一定要追问好吃在哪里。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2848">47:28</a> 回忆一下美食编辑的踩雷经历。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>徐大半：即刻@徐大半</span></p><span></span><p><span>美食编辑，上海江西潮汕三地混血，宁波祖籍</span></p><span></span><p><span>周大仙：即刻@盘丝大仙仙</span></p><span></span><p><span>美食编辑，四川自贡人，河南祖籍</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期BGM】</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：Today is My Day</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾：Humming House</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎进听众群，聊吃聊喝聊活着。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FufNNqgDWeuSC1dzWBJlatEVvUR-.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljYj4OEA5QaXOApBEz6rO_efTZk5.m4a" length="72482603" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Zwbm83bnhvcXlVTW0tLUFpTkIyU3NQcGYxQmIucG5n.png"/>
